{'symbol': 'KIM', 'date': '2021-08-03 13:13:00', 'title': 'KIMCO REALTY STOCKHOLDERS AND WEINGARTEN REALTY SHAREHOLDERS APPROVE MERGER', 'text': "JERICHO, N.Y. & HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--KIMCO REALTY CORP. (NYSE: KIM), ONE OF NORTH AMERICA'S LARGEST PUBLICLY TRADED OWNERS AND OPERATORS OF OPEN-AIR, GROCERY-ANCHORED SHOPPING CENTERS AND MIXED-USE ASSETS, AND WEINGARTEN REALTY INVESTORS (NYSE: WRI), A GROCERY-ANCHORED SUN BELT SHOPPING CENTER OWNER, MANAGER AND DEVELOPER, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT KIMCO STOCKHOLDERS AND WEINGARTEN SHAREHOLDERS APPROVED ALL OF THE PROPOSALS NECESSARY FOR THE CLOSING OF THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED MERGER OF WEINGAR"}